+GN source generation uses the host Go package selected by `DEPS` by default.
+To use another host Go executable, set `dawn_host_go_path` to its absolute path
+in the GN arguments. The Go version must satisfy `go.mod`. This selects a tool
+for the build host during cross-compilation. On Windows, include `.exe` in an
+explicit executable path. The source generator keeps Go modules enabled and
+CGO disabled.
+
 The most common GN build option is `is_debug=true/false`; otherwise
 `gn args out/Debug --list` shows all the possible options.
 
